__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"default",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return n}});var n="\nEffective Date: November 29, 2026\nOwner: Jonas Chan\n\n1. Introduction\nCourt Management Suite respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how your data is handled when using the app.\n\n2. Data Collection\nCourt Management Suite does not collect, transmit, or store any personal information online.\n\nAll data you create, including:\nPlayer names\nGroups\nCourt schedules\nSessions\n\n\u2026is stored locally on your device only. No information leaves your device.\n\n3. Data Usage\nThe app uses your local data only to manage your courts, sessions, groups, and players.\nYour data is never sent to servers.\nThe app does not track or monitor your usage.\nNo third-party analytics or advertising SDKs are used.\n\n4. Data Security\nWhile all data is stored locally:\nUsers are responsible for their device security (e.g., passwords, backups).\nDeleting the app may remove all local data.\n\n5. Third Parties\nCourt Management Suite does not share your data with third parties.\nNo external services or cloud storage are used.\n\n6. Changes to This Policy\nThis Privacy Policy may be updated occasionally.\nThe effective date will always be updated to indicate the most recent version.\n"},923,[]);
